  "solution": "Đặt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (km), ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>130</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>60</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>130</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>20500</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>260</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTheo đề bài tổng số tiền vận chuyển là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>500</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>20500</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>260</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (nghìn đồng).<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>130</mn></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>20500</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>260</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>85</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tBảng biến thiên <div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/805d681492b8544782eae60f1e681a0045bab5791b2d262f143b5226a4c7e2b7.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tVậy số tiền vận chuyển nhỏ nhất là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>63</mn></semantics></math> triệu đồng khi điểm trung chuyển <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> cách kho <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> một khoảng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>85</mn></semantics></math> km.",
